Test result:
- New tests (`tests/units/definitions`): 68 passed.
- Architecture tests: 9 passed (baseline tightened).
- Full unit suite (`uv run --frozen pytest tests/units -q -x -p no:cacheprovider`):
  9752 passed, 12 skipped, 18 warnings. One test deselected:
  `tests/units/api/test_routes.py::TestHealthRoutes::test_readiness_route_returns_checks`
  opens a real SQL warehouse connection from the local Databricks config and
  hangs in urllib3 retry backoff in this environment; it hangs identically on
  the unmodified base commit 8db023fa.
- mypy on the new modules: no issues.
- Real Unity Catalog check (fevm workspace, read-only app code, scratch schema
  created and dropped afterwards): `SHOW CREATE TABLE` of a v1.1 metric view
  parsed into expr / comment / synonyms for every column; MEASURE() probe
  returned the expected rows; first sync updated 2 definitions; changing the
  measure in UC reported the expr and comment before/after plus added/removed
  synonyms; dropping the view kept the last value with a
  `source_unavailable` warning; recreating it cleared the warning and the
  next sync was a no-op.
